<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-14T19:23:12.772Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:23:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran struck a US military radar in Bahrain in retaliation for a strike on southern Iran. Pakistan's security forces killed 74 terrorists in raids across Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and Balochistan, while an operation in North Waziristan left two soldiers dead and 14 terrorists killed. Two women were killed in a hit-and-run on Murree Road. Afghanistan’s Taliban-run government opened a new road to China, but the border remains closed, preventing its use. The conflict accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/13/iran-us-radar-bahrain-sirik-hormuz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/russia-sends-major-business-delegation-to-kabul-for-business-talks-with-the-taliban&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNY2htc0w1R1lPUGNzVXV5TVFtdXBZX2Q5N2g1M3lqYjI1OG1ad3VBd2JRSy02d3ZrR2ItckQ0N1FtRE1XMmo4TGYyRXNEYVpJZmxqRGs3a1l2X0xzY3hHdFduSklxay11eFpfeV9VMThSUWZ6NzRCazNtM0RKbTJXaTZFUk9TYXA1TEdmck8ySlh6WkRXZFctWjJVcTBsZHFCbVRfNGxmc1RzLUNOV2txbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sportstar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9lQUV1RWlPTlFUR3l6QXFtb0dmMXp6UGNKcWFkVElKYm43bEhRa3JhUkQ3aXFieHFCWktaZXpjZkh0STBfSWpTYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNdWpQX2NaazdWM3JrQjA2N1lGQjVjNVJIUm1HeFYyZ0E5VkNsSVhNUzIyeV9aSkt2U3BMMzY2am9GNGY1VE5JZlNqU09kZlNsdHYtSEZBb2JYNXlVVlpmMWRTUjJEY2tPYjVMZUpMUHM2Mm5DalY4MXkwNXR2Um8xSXRCQkd5TjdFanM0UjdXN01Mb1JBYjNRQUtKR1lzYnU0bXUxQnJkNTdseTFQeFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByalJUS1lwUlc1MWRPcHZzM1FxaGtvd